<title>HUNGARY: Mezogep enters mkt well above issue price.</title>
<headline>Mezogep enters mkt well above issue price.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in machinery company Mezogep Rt started trading at a price substantially above its IPO price of 1,880 forints, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock opened at 2,700 forints and at 1025 GMT it traded at 2,600 forints, with various securities houses on the buying side, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
